    "text": "sandiegoville.com\nwebsite\nSan Diego\nBirria Specialist Mike’s Red Tacos Expanding With Third San Diego Location In Mira Mesa\n2 days ago\nBeloved San Diego birria specialist Mike’s Red Tacos is gearing up to open its third brick-and-mortar location, this time in the busy Scripps Mesa neighborhood of Mira Mesa. The new outpost will take over the former Tofu House space on Mira Mesa Boulevard, further expanding the reach of one of the city's fastest-growing taco concepts.",
